{"data":{"degrees":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Ensino Médio Técnico em Desenvolvimento de Sistemas","school":"ETEC Taboão da Serra","date":"2023","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ce8bb/etects.jpg","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/d6b18/etects.jpg 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/fac6d/etects.jpg 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ce8bb/etects.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/1934d/etects.avif 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/4564e/etects.avif 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/62eae/etects.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/745fa/etects.webp 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/37527/etects.webp 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ea0a8/etects.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":399}}},"end":"2026","tech":["Lógica & Algoritmos","HTML5/CSS3/JS","Java/PHP (Backend)","SQL (MySQL/SQL Server)","Mobile (Android/Kotlin)","Análise de Sistemas (UML)","Teste de Software"],"external":"https://www.etec.sp.gov.br","lang":"pt"},"html":"<p>Programa técnico abrangente de 3 módulos focado na análise, design, desenvolvimento, teste e implantação de sistemas computacionais. O currículo enfatiza o desenvolvimento multiplataforma e práticas padrão da indústria.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Currículo Central:</strong> Domínio de <strong>Lógica de Programação &#x26; Algoritmos</strong>, modelagem de banco de dados relacional (MER/DER), implementação SQL e Programação Orientada a Objetos (POO).</li>\n<li><strong>Desenvolvimento Web &#x26; Mobile:</strong> Construção de aplicações web responsivas usando HTML, CSS, JavaScript e PHP/Java, juntamente com desenvolvimento mobile nativo para Android.</li>\n<li><strong>Engenharia &#x26; Qualidade:</strong> Aprendizado de <strong>Análise de Sistemas</strong> (Requisitos, Diagramação UML), Design de Interface (princípios UI/UX) e metodologias de Teste de Software.</li>\n<li><strong>Projeto de Conclusão (TCC):</strong> Desenvolvimento e documentação de uma solução de software completa para um problema real, gerenciando o ciclo de vida do projeto desde a concepção até a implantação.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Technical High School in Software Development","school":"ETEC Taboão da Serra","date":"2023","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ce8bb/etects.jpg","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/d6b18/etects.jpg 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/fac6d/etects.jpg 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ce8bb/etects.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/1934d/etects.avif 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/4564e/etects.avif 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/62eae/etects.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/745fa/etects.webp 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/37527/etects.webp 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ea0a8/etects.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":399}}},"end":"2026","tech":["Logic & Algorithms","HTML5/CSS3/JS","Java/PHP (Backend)","SQL (MySQL/SQL Server)","Mobile (Android/Kotlin)","Systems Analysis (UML)","Software Testing"],"external":"https://www.etec.sp.gov.br","lang":null},"html":"<p>Comprehensive 3-module technical program focused on the analysis, design, development, testing, and deployment of computational systems. The curriculum emphasizes multi-platform development and industry-standard practices.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Core Curriculum:</strong> Mastered <strong>Algorithms &#x26; Programming Logic</strong>, relational database modeling (MER/DER) and SQL implementation, and Object-Oriented Programming (OOP).</li>\n<li><strong>Web &#x26; Mobile Development:</strong> Built responsive web applications using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and PHP/Java, alongside native mobile Android development.</li>\n<li><strong>Engineering &#x26; Quality:</strong> Learned <strong>Systems Analysis</strong> (Requirements, UML Diagramming), Interface Design (UI/UX principles), and Software Testing methodologies.</li>\n<li><strong>Capstone Project (TCC):</strong> Developed and documented a complete software solution for a real-world problem, managing the project lifecycle from conception to deployment.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Bachelor's Degree in Information Systems","school":"Universidade de São Paulo (USP)","date":"2026","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/04e32/each-usp.jpg","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/d1021/each-usp.jpg 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/57bda/each-usp.jpg 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/04e32/each-usp.jpg 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/41a6e/each-usp.jpg 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/87ded/each-usp.avif 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/03f27/each-usp.avif 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/0388b/each-usp.avif 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/5cdf9/each-usp.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/5e303/each-usp.webp 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/192d2/each-usp.webp 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/7498b/each-usp.webp 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/3ef79/each-usp.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":464}}},"end":"2029","tech":["Data Structures & Algorithms","Database Systems","Software Engineering","Computer Networks","Operating Systems","Web Development"],"external":"https://www5.usp.br/","lang":null},"html":"<p>Comprehensive undergraduate program focused on the design, development, and management of information systems within organizational contexts. Combines strong technical foundations with practical applications in real-world environments.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Core Computing Foundations:</strong> Solid training in <strong>Data Structures, Algorithms, and Discrete Mathematics</strong>, enabling efficient problem-solving and system design.</li>\n<li><strong>Software Development:</strong> Hands-on experience with <strong>Software Engineering principles</strong>, including system architecture, version control, and agile methodologies.</li>\n<li><strong>Data Management:</strong> In-depth study of <strong>Database Systems</strong>, covering relational modeling, SQL, and data integrity.</li>\n<li><strong>Systems &#x26; Infrastructure:</strong> Understanding of <strong>Operating Systems and Computer Networks</strong>, providing the backbone for scalable and reliable applications.</li>\n<li><strong>Applied Technology:</strong> Focus on <strong>Web Development and Information Systems</strong>, bridging business needs with technological solutions.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Bacharelado em Sistemas de Informação","school":"Universidade de São Paulo (USP)","date":"2026","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/04e32/each-usp.jpg","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/d1021/each-usp.jpg 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/57bda/each-usp.jpg 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/04e32/each-usp.jpg 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/41a6e/each-usp.jpg 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/87ded/each-usp.avif 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/03f27/each-usp.avif 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/0388b/each-usp.avif 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/5cdf9/each-usp.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/5e303/each-usp.webp 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/192d2/each-usp.webp 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/7498b/each-usp.webp 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/3ef79/each-usp.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":464}}},"end":"2029","tech":["Estruturas de Dados & Algoritmos","Sistemas de Banco de Dados","Engenharia de Software","Redes de Computadores","Sistemas Operacionais","Desenvolvimento Web"],"external":"https://www5.usp.br/","lang":"pt"},"html":"<p>Graduação abrangente focada no projeto, desenvolvimento e gestão de sistemas de informação em contextos organizacionais. Combina fundamentos técnicos sólidos com aplicação prática em cenários reais.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fundamentos da Computação:</strong> Formação sólida em <strong>Estruturas de Dados, Algoritmos e Matemática Discreta</strong>, permitindo a resolução eficiente de problemas e o desenvolvimento de sistemas robustos.</li>\n<li><strong>Desenvolvimento de Software:</strong> Experiência prática com <strong>princípios de Engenharia de Software</strong>, incluindo arquitetura de sistemas, controle de versão e metodologias ágeis.</li>\n<li><strong>Gestão de Dados:</strong> Estudo aprofundado de <strong>Sistemas de Banco de Dados</strong>, abrangendo modelagem relacional, SQL e integridade de dados.</li>\n<li><strong>Sistemas &#x26; Infraestrutura:</strong> Compreensão de <strong>Sistemas Operacionais e Redes de Computadores</strong>, essenciais para aplicações escaláveis e confiáveis.</li>\n<li><strong>Tecnologia Aplicada:</strong> Foco em <strong>Desenvolvimento Web e Sistemas de Informação</strong>, conectando necessidades de negócio a soluções tecnológicas.</li>\n</ul>"}}]}}}